# React Native Styling Rules

- Co-locate styles in sibling `*.styles.ts` files.
- Use `StyleSheet.create`; export named styles.
- Use `@app/design-tokens` for colors, spacing, typography, radii, shadows, and z-index.
- Use Safe Area handling at screen boundaries.
- Respect dynamic type; avoid fixed text containers.
- No inline object styles except Reanimated hook results.
- No Tailwind/NativeWind, styled-components, @emotion, CSS modules, or magic numbers when tokens exist.
